                <pb facs="0083" n="49" sameAs="frus:frus1870/pg49"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">No. 3.</note>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Jay to Mr. Fish.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1870-08-08"><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >August 8, 1870.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Fish,</hi>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary, Washington:</hi></p>
                <p>Austria declines alliance proffered by France. War preparations and
                    fortifications continue, but only as precautionary and for defense.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>JAY.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
